# Build artifacts
Engine/build/
# `go build ./...` in Engine/ drops a binary next to the cgo shim's own
# package, named after its directory. Nothing needs it — the xcframework is
# built by build-xcframework.sh — but it appears whenever anyone builds the Go
# side to check it compiles (SOPS-39 task 10).
Engine/cshim/cshim
# xcodebuild's derived data. `mac-release`'s swift-xcodegen driver points
# -derivedDataPath here, so a release run drops a ~100 MB static archive and a
# signed .app into the working tree — one `git add -A` away from a push GitHub
# rejects outright (measured: libsopsbridge.a is 109 MB, over the hard limit).
/build/
.build/
DerivedData/
*.xcframework

# Headless UI snapshots (Scripts/snapshots.sh) — build output, never committed
.snapshots/

# Release credentials — never commit
release.local.env
*.p8
*.p12
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest

# Key material — tests generate throwaway keys at runtime, none belong in git
*.age
keys.txt

.DS_Store

# Worktrees live here (see CLAUDE.md)
.worktrees/

# Generated by XcodeGen from project.yml — never commit
SopsGUI.xcodeproj/

# SDD execution records — ledger, task reports, screenshots. Kept locally, not in git.
.superpowers/

# Release artifacts (DMG/ZIP). Built locally by mac-release; never committed.
dist/

# Local backup left by the _ai-memory cutover — never belongs in the repo.
CLAUDE.md.pre-aimem
